1
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:05,772
Guys!

2
00:00:05,772 --> 00:00:06,773
Gather around!

3
00:00:06,773 --> 00:00:08,017
You're not going to
believe this.

4
00:00:08,041 --> 00:00:10,143
We got ourselves an interview!

5
00:00:10,143 --> 00:00:11,611
- An interview?
- Yeah!

6
00:00:11,611 --> 00:00:13,179
It's all thanks to you guys!

7
00:00:16,015 --> 00:00:17,384
Cheers!

8
00:00:17,851 --> 00:00:18,852
This is just a beginning.

9
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:21,688
Our flower shop has such
a bright future ahead!

10
00:00:35,702 --> 00:00:36,536
Ok, here we go.

11
00:00:36,536 --> 00:00:38,104
Now, one, two, three!

12
00:00:38,104 --> 00:00:39,104
- Pizza!
- Chicken!

13
00:00:39,205 --> 00:00:40,507
- It's pizza.
- No, it's chicken.

14
00:00:43,676 --> 00:00:45,011
This is too much!

15
00:00:45,512 --> 00:00:47,747
- I can't eat them all.
- It's all yours.

16
00:00:48,181 --> 00:00:50,421
There's no way I can eat that.
Don't treat me like a pig.

17
00:00:50,884 --> 00:00:52,364
I don't think you'll have
any problem.

18
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:54,920
Stop it.

19
00:00:57,023 --> 00:00:58,558
Boss, have a glass.

20
00:00:59,192 --> 00:01:00,192
No thanks.

21
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:02,429
I'm going to go
to the bathroom.

22
00:01:15,975 --> 00:01:18,311
I thought you were going
to call me by my name.

23
00:01:21,381 --> 00:01:22,381
Yijun.
